  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A large amount of seasoned VRC players constantly play with \"Allow Untrusted URLs\" enabled. This presents unneeded risk when most users only intend to actually have untrusted URL's enabled for a small number of worlds. \n\nWhile an ideal solution would be making this setting per world (or instance type), a good simpler middle ground would be a setting like \"Auto Disable Avatar Cloning\" that disables \"Allow Untrusted URL's\" when loading into your next world. This would mitigate the hassle of having to remember to disable Allow Untrusted URL's before changing worlds.",
